From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CNMrLin <CNMrLin@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Use Qualcomm super buffers for high-speed capture requests

Use the app's high-speed request builder on Qualcomm devices. It reads the
HAL batch-size capability and submits one request when super buffers are
supported, avoiding a second request batch in the framework.

---
 smali/j9/y0.smali | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/smali/j9/y0.smali b/smali/j9/y0.smali
--- a/smali/j9/y0.smali
+++ b/smali/j9/y0.smali
@@ -12664,7 +12664,7 @@
 
     sget-boolean v0, LJe/c;->j:Z
 
-    if-eqz v0, :cond_1
+    if-nez v0, :cond_1
 
     iget-object v0, p0, Lj9/y0;->w:Landroid/hardware/camera2/CameraCaptureSession;
 
@@ -24887,7 +24887,7 @@
 
     sget-boolean v6, LJe/c;->j:Z
 
-    if-eqz v6, :cond_5
+    if-nez v6, :cond_5
 
     iget-object v6, p0, Lj9/y0;->F:Lj9/g0;
 
-- 
2.43.0
